  x `core/needs-build-tool` requires `build-tool` at or above `1.0`. Every
  | provider declares it `build-only`
   ,-[tests/repos/versioned/components/core/needs-build-tool/manifest.kdl:5:10]
 4 | 
 5 | requires "build-tool" min="1.0"
   :          ^^^^^^|^^^^^
   :                `-- gone from the final image
